I can't decide whether to laugh or cry ... this is truly the stupidest
thing I have ever done.

THREE DAYS nursing this wizard along. Wondering if I was ready.

Everything went smoothly. Rolled a =oSlowDig, DL1 wish from a fountain
gave me SDSM, DL1 altar gave me Magicbane. Enchanted it to +2 almost
immediately, got it to +7 before the end. Never wielded another weapon
for any serious length of time.

Found a few bones, some mine, some from Hearse. None really gave me
anything essential though they certainly helped.

The two or three times in the early game that I was really close to
death, I kept my head, thought it through, and survived.  Once I wrote
a +oCharm Monster I was pretty much set; as Jove said it's the closest
thing to instawin that there is.  Got basic at riding skill and rode a
series of jabberwocks and dragons for a while. Toyed with a lance
toward the end, but it was -1 so I eventually dropped it.

Had trouble finding Vlad's ladder because something was on it, but
reasoned out (with spoilers) what level it should be on. It wasn't
there, but I kept looking and found it.  [Spoiler says it must be
betwen G13-G18, but mine was on G10! G13-G15 were the Wizard's Tower;
G16 was Orcus; G17 and G18 were open mazes.]

Killed Vlad. Killed the Wiz. Came back up to prepare for the Sanctum
run, and Rodney showed up on my stash level. Killed him quick with
FoD, which I got very handy using. I tinned his corpse as a souvenir,
to go with the woodchuck I found somewhere.

Did the Sanctum, faster than I have before the three or four times
I've gotten that far. (I've ascended once before, with a Valk.) Came
straight up, not much Mysterious Force interference, killed Rodney
twice more.  Re-equipped at the stash level. Did a little polypiling
there too, just to try to get some more ?oDetectGold, and NOW I
finally get a ?oGenocide. Genoed L; not sure if this was the right
move this late in the game, but couldn't really think of what else to
do. Maybe I shoulda done ;. Anyhow.

Rise the five levels from my stash to the top.
"Well done, mortal! But now thou must face the final test .."
"So thou thought thou couldst kill me, fool."

As expected. And I remembered this time that I can tell the two @
apart by the / command. So I figured which was Rodney, and prepared to
FoD him again... my fingers fumbled and I hit the space bar twice
instead of once ...

"What a strange direction!"
"The energy is released!"
"You irradiate yourself with pure energy!"
"You die ..."
"DYWYPI?"

Sigh. This was really fun... Oh well. I guess I've learned something.
Not sure what ....


